testsuite: CoFDP runner for the single-node executor benchmark

* testsuite/performance_benchmark_cofdp.sh --cofdp (300 blocks of
  apt-fa-transfer, FLOW=MAINNET) and --cofdp-time (apt-fa-transfer-sj,
  block generation stops after 530 s, FLOW=ADHOC).
* single_node_performance.py: FLOW=MAINNET/ADHOC are reduced to these two
  tests; the DB is created under $COFDP_APTOS_DIR (set by the runner, default
  /home/femu/tenant0/p1); the time-based mode; parsing and reporting of the
  block count, run time and latency percentiles.
* Calibration row for apt-fa-transfer-sj.

Base: aptos-labs/aptos-core main at commit
      2f99b2fbeb63ee3ee4d8fbdbd1aba164e39ed7b8 (2025-12-29)
Apply: git apply 0002-testsuite-cofdp-runner.patch
License: this patch modifies aptos-core and is subject to aptos-core's
         Innovation-Enabling Source Code License (see LICENSE and README.md);
         the testsuite/ scripts keep their upstream Apache-2.0 headers.

